  "description": "Backend service implementing the FDC3 Desktop Agent standard for ComposeUI. Handles requests from FDC3 client libraries, enabling applications to interoperate using FDC3 context, intents, and channels. Provides APIs for app discovery, context sharing, and intent resolution, with integration for FDC3 App Directory and support for dependency injection. Compatible with .NET Standard 2.0. More Details: https://morganstanley.github.io/ComposeUI/",
